<title>USA: Vt. Teddy sues Disney over trademark.</title>
<headline>Vt. Teddy sues Disney over trademark.</headline>
<dateline>SHELBURNE, Vt. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vermont Teddy Bear Co said on Tuesday that it filed suit against a Walt Disney Co subsidiary for infringing upon its Bear-Gram trademark.</p>
<p>The suit seeks injunctive relief and unspecified damages from Disney Enterprises Inc's direct marketing of &quot;Pooh-Grams,&quot; Vermont Teddy Bear said.</p>
<p>Disney representatives in Burbank, Calif., could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
</text>
